  "comments": "<p>“The 1969 Grand Voilier - Grande Date model is a rare variety. A small quantity was struck early in the year before it was discovered that the original design had deteriorated to the point of being unsuitable for further use. A completely new design with a much smaller schooner and date replaced the original die in early 1969. The obverse is like the 1965-1968 issues. As of April 2010, only sixteen examples of the large-date variety have been certified.” - Standard Charlton catalog Volume I</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6745f46c49422.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6745f46c49422.jpg\"></a></p><p><strong>Thickness 1978:</strong> 1.19 mm</p>",
